\">\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n  <div class=\"grid     \">\n\n    <div id=\"64ad66\" class=\"article-text\">\n      \n      <p>The household budget can only be calculated from the age of 18 onwards.</p>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n\n  \n\n\n</div>","scrBudgetCalculator_Result_HouseholdIncomeNetInfo":"<div class=\"articletext-component\">\n    \n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/etc.clientlibs/pfch/clientlibs/components/article-text.pf-20260819134901.min.css\" type=\"text/css\">\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n  <div class=\"grid     \">\n\n    <div id=\"2f9da3\" class=\"article-text\">\n      \n      <p>Salary deductions are factored into the net income.</p>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n\n  \n\n\n</div>","scrBudgetCalculator_Result_bottom":"<div class=\"quote-component\">\n    \n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/etc.clientlibs/pfch/clientlibs/components/quote.pf-20260819134901.min.css\" type=\"text/css\">\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"grid\">\n    <div class=\"quote  \">\n        <blockquote class=\"quote__quote\">Our household budget calculator helps you to keep track of your finances (expenditure and income) with ease.</blockquote>\n        <div class=\"quote__source\">Fabio Cappelli, Head of PostFinance branch Horgen/Meilen</div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n\n    \n    \n    <div class=\"articlecolumns-component\">\n    \n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/etc.clientlibs/pfch/clientlibs/components/articlecolumns.pf-20260819134901.min.css\" type=\"text/css\">\n<script src=\"/etc.clientlibs/pfch/clientlibs/components/articlecolumns.pf-20260819134901.min.js\"></script>\n\n\n\n\n\n<div data-component=\"ArticleColumns\" class=\"grid     \">\n    <div id=\"2f6ec2\" class=\"articlecolumns \">\n        <div class=\"articlecolumns__inner one-sixth\">\n            <h2 class=\"articlecolumns__title articlecolumns__title--both\">\n                 We will be pleased to set aside time for a personal consultation\n            </h2>\n            \n            <div class=\"articlecolumns__col articlecolumns__col--left\">\n                \n\n\n\n\n    \n    \n    <div class=\"articleimage-component\">\n    \n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/etc.clientlibs/pfch/clientlibs/components/articleimage.pf-20260819134901.min.css\" type=\"text/css\">\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"grid     \">\n    <figure class=\"article-image\">\n        <div id=\"a488b2\" class=\"article-image__container\">\n            \n            <img src=\"/content/dam/pfch/image/icon_svg/ico_pers%C3%B6nliche_beratung%201_96px.svg/_jcr_content/renditions/original.media_file.file/ico_pers%C3%B6nliche_beratung%201_96px.svg\" alt=\"\" data-cmp-hook-image=\"image\" itemprop=\"contentUrl\" class=\"article-image--image\"/>\n        </div>\n        \n    </figure>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"articlecolumns__col articlecolumns__col--right\">\n                \n\n\n\n\n    \n    \n    <div class=\"articletext-component\">\n    \n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/etc.clientlibs/pfch/clientlibs/components/article-text.pf-20260819134901.min.css\" type=\"text/css\">\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n  <div class=\"grid     \">\n\n    <div id=\"ae3789\" class=\"article-text\">\n      \n      <p>Do you have any questions? Arrange a consultation appointment now.</p>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n\n  \n\n\n</div>\n\n\n    \n    \n    <div class=\"linklist-component\">\n\n  \n    <div class=\"grid     \">\n      \n  \n    \n    \n      \n      \n        <div class=\"linklist linklist--default\">\n          <div class=\"linklist--item section\">\n\n  \n  \n\n  \n    \n  \n  \n    \n  \n\n  <a class=\" link link-arrow linklist--item--link   \" href=\"/content/pfch/en/support/cc/ccpriv\" target=\"_self\" tabindex=\"0\">\n    \n    <div class=\"link__content\">\n      <span class=\"link__text\">Contact us</span>\n      \n        <span class=\"rte-icon-after\"><span class=\"rte-icon-after-container\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"rte-icon-after-box\">\n   <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\">\n    <use href=\"#chevron-right-16\"></use>\n   </svg>\n   <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\">\n    <use href=\"#chevron-right-16\"></use>\n   </svg></span></span></span>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div>\n  </a>\n\n\n    \n    \n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/etc.clientlibs/pfch/clientlibs/components/link.pf-20260819134901.min.css\" type=\"text/css\">\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n        </div>\n      \n    \n  \n\n    </div>\n  \n  \n\n\n  \n    \n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/etc.clientlibs/pfch/clientlibs/components/linklist.pf-20260819134901.min.css\" type=\"text/css\">\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n    \n    \n    <div class=\"promoboxgrid-component\">\n    \n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/etc.clientlibs/pfch/clientlibs/components/promoboxgrid.pf-20260819134901.min.css\" type=\"text/css\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/etc.clientlibs/pfch/clientlibs/components/promobox.pf-20260819134901.min.css\" type=\"text/css\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/etc.clientlibs/pfch/clientlibs/components/button.pf-20260819134901.min.css\" type=\"text/css\">\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"grid   \">\n    <div class=\"promoboxgrid\">\n        \n\n\n\n\n    \n    \n    <div class=\"promobox-component\"><div class=\"promobox petrol\" id=\"047702\">\n  <header class=\"promobox__header\">\n    <h2 class=\"promobox__title\">Tailor your retirement planning</h2>\n    <strong class=\"promobox__subtitle\"></strong>\n  </header>\n  \n  <div class=\"promobox__text richtext\">\n    <p>Your retirement needs may vary depending on where you are in life. What’s important to you when it comes to retirement planning?</p>\n\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"promobox__action_container\">\n    \n    \n  \n    \n    \n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/etc.clientlibs/pfch/clientlibs/shared/dialog/common/primarySecondaryButtons.pf-20260819134901.min.css\" type=\"text/css\">\